    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Mother’s Joy",
      "",
      "A mother had two sons. The eldest sold umbrellas. The second-eldest sold vegetables out in the open.",
      "",
      "On sunny days, the mother worried that nobody would buy her eldest son’s umbrellas, ..",
      ".. and on rainy days, she worried that nobody would buy her second-eldest son’s vegetables, ..",
      ".. so every day she was not happy.",
      "",
      "After her good friend said a few words with her, from that day onwards, ..",
      ".. the mother was happy for her eldest son on rainy days, and happy for her second-eldest son on sunny days.",
      "",
      "Do you know what that friend said to the mother?",
      ""
